    "note": "prior_win_rate seeds the PFSP prior so a fresh run does not spend its first few thousand episodes rediscovering which decks are unwinnable. It is a SEED and never a gate: the live per-deck estimate is count-weighted early (alpha = max(0.05, 1/(n+1))), so a deck this policy cannot beat falls under POOL_WINRATE_FLOOR within one to three matches per worker. These numbers come from a TRAINED policy, so for a fresh net read them as a difficulty ORDERING, not as a level."
